{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t通明街與牛頭角道交界，中午12時許發生交通意外，一輛輕型貨車駛至該處，懷疑撞倒一名正在過路的82女子，她後腦受傷昏迷，被送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。<br/>\n<br/>\n警方表示，經初步調查後，涉事的40歲男司機涉嫌危險駕駛被捕，正被扣留調查。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：鍾慧儀\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T08:54:05.268866+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T08:34:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T12:58:54.188294+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T08:47:29.856706+00:00","content_hash":"64d3e632126cbe4448937427e22836014523006794f20834b3ebe444df4f650f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}